      "content": "\"just a number\"?? that's kinda scary to hear. i've always been told high blood pressure is a big deal. if i just stay home and keep an eye on it like you suggested, what are the actual signs that mean i've messed up and actually need to call 911? i don't want to waste an ambulance's time if it really was just a \"blip\" like you said.",
